 "notes": [
  "Non-GAAP adjustments are printed per segment (pre-tax) and only in aggregate after tax (items_total_*); per-item after-tax amounts are not published, so item 'net' is omitted and check_rec's start_ni + items_net check differs by exactly items_total_net.",
  "Definition change announced: beginning 2016 adjusted results exclude deal-related amortization. The Q4-15 / FY2015 headline adjusted EPS (from continuing operations) does NOT exclude it; recast figures (Exhibits 9-10) are in 'recast_deal_amort_2015' and are not used in ngaap.",
  "Twelve-month column of the Q4-15 release (as originally reported).",
  "IS 'Other (income) loss' (11) = gain of $11m on sale of interest in a legacy McGraw Hill Construction investment (Q2) -> gain_disp 11.",
  "IS footnote: 2015 includes legal settlements partially offset by insurance recoveries of $54m (net).",
  "Ratings adj 68 = net legal settlements 54 + restructuring 13 (67; rounding). CIQ & SNL adj 69 = operating-efficiency/restructuring 32 + acquisition-related 37. C&C 1 = restructuring. Unallocated -2 = gain 11 reversed + restructuring (~9 by difference, computed).",
  "Segment OP total + adjustments: 2,055 + 138 = 2,193 vs printed adjusted segment OP 2,192 (rounding); adj unallocated 139 vs 138 + 2 = 140 (rounding).",
  "Effective tax rate 30.1%; adjusted 30.5% (text).",
  "S&P Dow Jones Indices Adjusted Net Operating Profit (attributable) = 291 (OP 392 less NCI 101).",
  "Organic revenue: Total Adjusted Revenue 5,204 vs 5,049 (+3%); constant currency 5,317 vs 5,049 (+5%).",
  "Q4-16 release recasts FY2015 into the new segment structure (Market and Commodities Intelligence rev 2,376, OP 585, adj OP 712) \u2014 not used here."
 ],
